{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_02bfd67211e541db19d07f1dea0d607b7eb65749e2da63599f7027bba43f32c8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_adc700076f4ac1f67e73f7f60297268a9542fb920efc114dfaa15ae064faca14"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"For high-risk decisions an Expert Panel reviews a frozen question through correctness, security, performance, architecture, and reproducibility lenses, debating anonymously up to three rounds before a deterministic arbiter that preserves minority opinions and fails closed to human review.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_23081dd23f39173f016b8f9cf5aba564230e7a1160bbb8ba433677875c1df6ef","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ba80b4076db41b8a5ccd426ba1441279248fa021aca339b104df22e73ff525b"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"The preset MCP catalog derives risk tiers from the catalog template rather than user config, and servers default to not-connected with write and external-fetch operations behind approval gates.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_28e6d3a3240321e8276a3f13a1f7554d883fa3ece3870444b9e4f00ede23033f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_366f16cfda7297a084abe5271db1eaafea5eb4fd751e022220eafd20409fba07","slc_9bda25f7f8ab2bf4563f64703be9c4d3a4597433fa3bcdd84c6f0c41e4334a91"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"Persistent state lives in typed documents (knowledge, strategy, methodology, skill, memory, design, worklog, diagnosis, eval) linked via supports/blocks/conflicts/validates into a traversable graph, with scope layers from session-private to sealed audit-only material.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_54771ee885d68ccc5c4750792639e52ed121b90a3747c4cefdade68ee4b46554","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2eceb5a4b635e663a870bc4182fd76fef96afa5606cc24dbc76f0862e153d98a","slc_b5fe4587b90fd1813ea3aa03e6649d30fd76ec4373745207d00ed2a5dc8c18ba","slc_b86971a45a04d6803e3d2e90530a7e7501703e0457f6f0ff1883598c9ad7a99b","slc_b9717766fb5e697e6a99bfc835e2ade6da27620bf0c40f0de47eab7181638445","slc_be4cced9554f71c2c9cd2396398c3606d7824d7f9f71d8f239db03ba2dffaf03"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"The product ships as a desktop app and a terminal CLI; the CLI supports `deepagent auth login`, `deepagent auth list`, and `deepagent-code run \"<task>\"`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6673651db53f53de51238100a758a96a3f38c7e41a8c8393ddbbb68db52363a0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c9f2679ff92bacbb165a4982ae81db70232f6e7ba651e50d17657217b8f5ff7c","slc_deafb428893103d38e92f5b839e0e9e6cb12638a34668d7b306eb31fcbc8989e"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"The project builds with Bun 1.3.14 and is provider-agnostic, supporting 75+ providers via the AI SDK and models.dev plus any OpenAI- or Anthropic-compatible endpoint.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6f658f2e0cb6000519a44b1de0a87934e4d06e6efca5fbb06f28fa916f986ba4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1aafac3c7774605e8f010b21f2355437edcbe9dcfc17df3c47851027709bbfda","slc_40368f46f081adf9ca2b1cd5550509faecf5217e644fdb94ef81d2a38980cc17","slc_ecdeca8106ce0fdc8303cd3efa4dfac809e12ffe1b82f114b3615a57fb57db16"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"The project is licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later and is derived from opencode under the MIT License with NOTICE attribution; an enterprise edition exists in a separate repository.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7d43ca997771a9a73ee3c124ea1adc7cbe2163bb18489bbc320cbff4a5d384b4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1251551dd80b122208794ac89e544e0a32361e9f874cf8a853ae150690fd0c37","slc_80f2fa7643ce214119bfbbc1d33f3b9271e61d8b0ab0399adebcaf1d97eb1c49","slc_cb5a8b9e8da51e523e011268efd64f5b13dc42468a584274bff57a85336e0313"],"source_ids":["src_1e2d9542464c5550acde28c36737b960","src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"Context assembly uses a durable Context Epoch: stable system instructions stay byte-stable for prompt caching while volatile state is appended in a dedicated tail block, and context changes are admitted only at safe provider-turn boundaries.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8816eb9058ae23b4ed3f99e85eb7a97a840410ca9c21a66301dc83963196c4aa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3542f62677e589392fab51ea8cebb1185273f94698a361ec06a6e0833e9e9896","slc_5f85504d4f608b699c19ddf76bd5ea3114823b47adad85dd3b4f458fe3fa69a8"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"Write-capable subagents get dedicated worktrees and return compact summaries; a Reviewer session checks each exact worker SHA, the coordinator performs serial `--no-ff` merges, and generation fencing prevents stale workers from settling or overwriting newer work.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b526bd398a1ba102298cf99934337f3e19584661910112bc7809b387e1303448","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_36cf44e7650fb03c37931f74bf7b31a9c6488af4c03463e8de848a182148ca1e","slc_5959a938b733a610da82b5b2c6e7daed056a693301e3a3568d713ed99d7b211d"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"Providers are configured in `~/.deepagent/code/config.jsonc`; a custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint can set `discovery: true` for runtime model refresh or list models explicitly under `models`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b6a1fe8e96f4337e9ffba6228b83f5e6bd7ee541dc29d05ef11e2270d79f2487","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2eceb5a4b635e663a870bc4182fd76fef96afa5606cc24dbc76f0862e153d98a","slc_b73a507483abf55fc7f43b19249c200fcb95177398719822be877429a541a5f7"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"The `deepagent-code` npm package is not yet publicly published; installation is via the desktop app or a curl install script.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ccccd1d6a08d85c7d54bac050862c7777dc5632dd5833efc4b91ae7ac3c3a7f0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8116b2cab9de4fbfc6fdda0001214c9bb82e6913281dd5e4607b87604937579b"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"Learning follows a governed lifecycle: evidence creates a candidate, isolated review or human decision changes its status, and regression/ablation gates publish a reproducible knowledge snapshot; rejection reasons persist so discarded patterns are not silently relearned.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ead25eab29b929c50ad91e7a5f2755df919d8dabba2ead37f599a5f7f32eb0a9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code@57be03002bc4 snapshot 0b8d0383da0604bb","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1dc2b994f1a523d86bc60e7fd220372772d7b60ac04c7f7d3ab8948d117e1cc8","slc_a85c95f141b641cbf3cbea0b216c693f4a94325a4b076d0640925d9db5690905"],"source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"text":"Three collaboration modes are offered: Auto (end-to-end execution), Loop (editable `goal+plan.md` advanced through plan, execute, verify, iterate ticks), and Design (faithful execution of a user-written plan); autonomy and permission levels are independent of mode.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
